  "handle": "personalized-in-this-classroom-inspirational-text-doormat",
  "description": "<p>This personalized doormat offers a warm welcome to any classroom or learning space. Designed with a composition notebook style, it adds a unique and cheerful touch while also serving as a functional piece of decor. Its primary use is to greet students and guests, providing a personalized and inviting atmosphere.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalize with the teacher's name for a unique classroom touch.</li>\n<li>Thoughtful gift for teachers for various occasions.</li>\n<li>Soft and durable non-woven fabric top with non-slip backing.</li>\n<li>Effectively dries wet feet and traps dirt to keep floors clean.</li>\n<li>Versatile for both indoor and outdoor use in classrooms, entryways, and RVs.</li>\n<li>Washable and easy to clean with mild liquid soap.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Composition Notebook Style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Hose down or sponge clean with mild liquid soap; avoid bleaching; air dry.</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This doormat is suitable for classrooms, entryways, and RVs, offering a welcoming touch. It can be used in both indoor and outdoor settings to enhance the space.</p>",
